@startuml Sombra
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 25
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  BorderThickness 2
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color Black
  Thickness 1.5
}
skinparam titleFontColor #D32F2F

title Sombra

rectangle "Cuerpo" as Cuerpo
rectangle "Sombra" as Sombra
rectangle "Luz" as Luz
rectangle "Superficie" as Superficie

Luz -up-> Cuerpo : incide
Cuerpo -right-> Sombra : proyecta
Sombra -down-> Superficie : aparece en
@enduml
